        "content": "\n\n**PayFix – Dispute Agent (test mode)**\n**Step 1 – Intake**\n1. POST /dispute arrives from the app\n2. Secret header is checked\n3. Ticket ID created (DSP-timestamp)\n4. Payment ID trimmed of extra spaces\nNeeds: Header Auth credential",
