    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "\n**Step 2 – Payment check**\n1. Real payment fetched from Razorpay by ID\n2. Not found? Flow continues, agent escalates\n3. Converts paise to ₹\n4. Calculates days since payment\nNeeds: Razorpay API keys (test mode)",
