    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "**Step 3 – AI decision**\n1. Agent searches the company policy (Supabase)\n2. Gemini picks auto_refund, escalate or reject\n3. Cites the policy section and the reason\n4. Build Case packs the result for Step 4\nNeeds: Gemini API key, Supabase credential (policy loaded)",
