        "content": "\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n**Step 4 – Act, notify, respond**\n1. auto_refund: Razorpay refund, sheet marked refunded\n2. escalate: reviewer emailed (analyst or senior compliance)\n3. Customer emailed, case logged, app gets the result\n4. Refund amount comes from Razorpay, never the complaint\nNeeds: Razorpay Basic Auth, Gmail, Google Sheets (cases tab)",
